Hmmm, I may have misdiagnosed the problem since both RMySQL and RPostgreSQL 
do define their own dbObjectId classes.  Perhaps the design could be 
simplified by avoiding multiple inheritance by changing

setClass("PostgreSQLObject", representation("DBIObject", "dbObjectId", 
"VIRTUAL"))

to 

setClass("PostgreSQLObject", representation("DBIObject", "VIRTUAL"))

and then converting the old "dbObjectId" methods to be "PostgreSQLObject" 
methods instead. 

Hadley

